@startuml
title UML State Chart Diagram - Green Rides

[*] --> InitialState

state InitialState <<entry point>>
InitialState : entry / User logs in and selects destination
InitialState : exit / Journey details displayed

InitialState --> DrivingOptions : select driving mode or other options

state DrivingOptions <<choice>>
DrivingOptions --> DrivingMode : activate driving mode
DrivingOptions --> OtherOptions : choose other options

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / activated driving mode
DrivingMode : do / navigate and drive
DrivingMode : exit / continue driving

DrivingMode --> Notifications : accident detected
DrivingMode --> JourneyCompletion : journey completed

state Notifications <<entry point>>
Notifications : entry / send notifications during driving or accident
Notifications : do / inform relevant authorities and user
Notifications : exit / notifications sent

Notifications --> DrivingMode : continue driving
Notifications --> AccidentHandling : handle accident details

state AccidentHandling <<entry point>>
AccidentHandling : entry / process accident information
AccidentHandling : do / coordinate response
AccidentHandling : exit / handled

AccidentHandling --> [*] : proceed to completion

state OtherOptions <<choice>>
OtherOptions --> HungryOption : select place to eat
OtherOptions --> JourneyCompletion : continue journey

state HungryOption <<entry point>>
HungryOption : entry / search for places to eat
HungryOption : do / view menu and order if hungry
HungryOption : exit / order placed or declined

HungryOption --> OtherOptions : back to options
HungryOption --> JourneyCompletion : continue journey

state JourneyCompletion <<entry point>>
JourneyCompletion : entry / end of journey
JourneyCompletion : do / provide feedback
JourneyCompletion : exit / feedback recorded

JourneyCompletion --> [*] : journey complete

@enduml
